1
00:00:03,238 --> 00:00:06,028
Sheldon Cooper's
descent into madness...

2
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:09,517
day two.

3
00:00:09,517 --> 00:00:11,047
It's 2:25 a.m.,

4
00:00:11,052 --> 00:00:14,992
and I feel the urge to urinate.

5
00:00:14,989 --> 00:00:18,289
My normal urination time
is 7:10 a.m.,

6
00:00:18,292 --> 00:00:21,232
but here I am,
in the middle of the night,

7
00:00:21,229 --> 00:00:23,399
struggling to keep my mind sharp

8
00:00:23,397 --> 00:00:27,197
and my pajamas dry.

9
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:28,501
It's only a matter of time

10
00:00:28,503 --> 00:00:33,073
before my tenuous grasp
on reality fades.

11
00:00:33,074 --> 00:00:37,044
I suppose I should pee while
I still know what a toilet is.

12
00:00:39,881 --> 00:00:43,881
(hums tune)

13
00:00:43,885 --> 00:00:47,215
(repeats tune)

14
00:00:48,089 --> 00:00:51,489
(repeats tune)

15
00:00:51,492 --> 00:00:54,362
(Leonard:)Since when do you hum songs?

16
00:00:54,362 --> 00:00:55,492
(Sheldon:)What are you talking
about?

17
00:00:55,496 --> 00:00:56,796
(Leonard:)You were just humming.
Are you sure?

18
00:00:56,797 --> 00:00:59,767
(Sheldon:)Sometimes when my brain
really gets moving,

19
00:00:59,767 --> 00:01:02,337
(Sheldon:)it makes noise.

